Adds createCustomCaFetch, a base transport trusting a connection-supplied CA, because Kubernetes API servers almost always use a cluster-private CA and the platform fetch cannot trust one. Node uses an undici Agent loaded on first use, Bun its native tls option, and Workers fails with a 400 rather than using the default trust store. Also adds an accessor for a guarded fetch's bound network policy so swapping the transport keeps it, and moves isCloudflareWorkerRuntime from mail to core so the check has one owner.
